`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
- `runWorkflowOnSelection` uses `.focusedSceneValue` — SwiftUI's scene-scoped environment that persists across focus changes between toolbar and content. This is why `browserSelection` doesn't go nil when clicking the toolbar.
- `allFeaturesEnabled || flagEnabledInternal` is a clean feature-flag pattern — one master switch (`FICHERO_ALL_FEATURES=1`) overrides all individual flags, perfect for testing environments.
